# ADRs

- Read [`adr/README.md`](../../adr/README.md) for status vocabulary and the index before opening individual ADR files.
- Store ADRs in repository-root `adr/` only.
- Filename pattern: `adr-NNNN-[title-slug].md` (4-digit sequence).
- Use the `create-architectural-decision-record` skill in `.agents/skills/create-architectural-decision-record/`.
- Do not rewrite binding decisions without documenting status changes; update the README index when status changes.
